<title>USA: Rural/Metro Corp renews contracts.</title>
<headline>Rural/Metro Corp renews contracts.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rural/Metro Corp said Thursday it has renewed its &quot;911&quot; and general transport ambulance services contract with Orange County, Fla., and its &quot;911&quot; contract with Rochester, N.Y.</p>
<p>The Orange County contract has been extended through September 1998 while the Rochester contract has been extended through September 1998 with a further two-year option depending on performance.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement combined annual revenues from the two contract renewals are expected to be about $25 million.</p>
</text>
